Earn a GRAD Aggies Professional Development Foundations Certificate in a week!

  1) Attend &amp; actively engage in 6 of the 15+ virtual GRAD Aggies sessions being offered the week of Oct 6-10. To view all sessions being offered click here.
  2) Complete their associated reflections (shared during sessions) to earn your 6 Professional Development Units (PDUs) towards the Foundations Certificate.&#160;
  3) After your 6th session, submit the reflection to claim your Foundations Certificate.&#160;

  Your Foundations Certificate will be awarded at the Graduate &amp; Professional School’s Annual Awards Ceremony in May 2027.&#160;
